title: University audit + Rune core agent + Conductor workspace complete — massive session wrap
summary: 'Largest single session in Paradigm history: shipped v5.23.0 through v5.30.0 (8 releases). Conductor evolved from floating overlay to full workspace app with embedded SwiftTerm terminals (4 sprints). Rune (compliance) added as 8th core agent for symbol hygiene. Cross-team Symphony debate with Neverland reached consensus on PAN evolution plan. University audit identified 8-phase restructuring plan (PARA 001 quick start, enforcement levels, quick-check mode, 5-to-54 agent bridge, Rune coverage, quiz upgrades). Also: README rewrite on side branch, AgentScope competitive analysis, Neverland pillars response, nickname-based agent lookup, reindex 80KB→500B fix, shift non-interactive default, minimal enforcement default, drag-drop file support, Cmd+/- font sizing.'
